dep4 --> TMFC024 : TMF678 Customer Bill Management
dep5 --> TMFC024 : TMF670 Payment Method Management
dep6 --> TMFC024 : TMF676 Payment Management
dep7 --> TMFC024 : TMF654 Prepay Balance Management
dep8 --> TMFC024 : TMF622 Product Ordering Management
dep9 --> TMFC024 : TMF671 Process Flow Management

' Exposed APIs leave the component on the right (lollipop connectors in the source image)
' Note: the source image's exposed side lists only TMF666 and TMF701, even
