() "TMF666 Account Management" as exp1
() "TMF701 Process Flow" as exp2

TMFC024 --> exp1 : TMF666 Account Management
TMFC024 --> exp2 : TMF701 Process Flow

legend right
  eTOM Business Activities = dashed-outline rectangles
